    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20634" root="سمج" body-key="s">
    
      10 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استسمجهُ</span></b>  <i>He reckoned it,</i> or <i>esteemed it,
foul, unseemly,</i> or <i>ugly;</i> (S, O;) or <i>devoid of
beauty.</i> (L.) One says, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَنَا أَسْتَسْمِجُ فِعْلَكَ</span> [<i>I
reckon,</i> or <i>esteem, thy deed foul,</i> or <i>unseemly</i>].
(A, TA.)

